Package: waydesk-portal
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: StackCare <jose@stackcare.pt>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: waydesk-server (= @VERSION@)
Recommends: qrencode
Replaces: waydesk-server (<< 0.6.0)
Breaks: waydesk-server (<< 0.6.0)
Description: Waydesk portal: desktops in a browser, and several servers in one place
 A small HTTPS server: people sign in and open their desktop in a browser
 (no client to install); administrators manage servers, people and sessions
 for several servers, each of which dials out to the portal with the agent
 (waydesk-agent enrol, in waydesk-server). Starts nothing by itself: see
 /usr/share/doc/waydesk-portal/README.md.
